      { source: "The Library of Babel", quote: "Like all men of the Library, I have traveled in my youth; I have wandered in search of a book, perhaps the catalogue of catalogues." },
      { source: "The Book of Sand", quote: "The line is made up of an infinite number of points; the plane of an infinite number of lines; the volume of an infinite number of planes..." },
